 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG VALUE 417.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-C                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-GO                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TOK                 PIC X(24) OCCURS 7 TIMES.
 01 WS-NUM                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 7 TIMES.
